    "title": "\u062a\u0631\u0627\u0628\u0631\u0646\u062a \u0631\u0627\u0646\u0646\u062f\u06af\u0627\u0646 | \u0627\u0639\u0644\u0627\u0645 \u0628\u0627\u0631",
    "description": "Trabrnet is an internet freight system and nationwide cargo declaration in Iran\r\n\r\nIf you are looking to transport more loads and earn more money and want to be your own boss, download the Trabarnet drivers application now. With Trabrent, you can choose the desired route and cargo suitable for your truck from among thousands of loads announced all over Iran at any time and anywhere.\r\n\r\nAdvantages of Trabrent for truck drivers\r\n\r\nLoad announcement based on the type of loader and the location of the driver\r\nFair pricing (transparent driver transparency)\r\nThe possibility of direct communication with the cargo declarant\r\nmore income\r\nthe usual load\r\nThe latest bar announcements in Trabarnet bar announcement hall\r\n\r\n\r\nEach time, the beginning of a long-term cooperation\r\nTrabarnet drivers application is provided based on your needs, dear drivers, with the aim of solving your constant concerns. This application is very easy to use and our support team will be by your side in all stages from selection to delivery.\r\n\r\nBe in touch with us\r\n\r\n021-57763300\r\nTelegram: @taraabarnet\r\nInstagram: Taraabarnet",
    "descriptionHTML": "Trabrnet is an internet freight system and nationwide cargo declaration in Iran<br><br>If you are looking to transport more loads and earn more money and want to be your own boss, download the Trabarnet drivers application now. With Trabrent, you can choose the desired route and cargo suitable for your truck from among thousands of loads announced all over Iran at any time and anywhere.<br><br>Advantages of Trabrent for truck drivers<br><br>Load announcement based on the type of loader and the location of the driver<br>Fair pricing (transparent driver transparency)<br>The possibility of direct communication with the cargo declarant<br>more income<br>the usual load<br>The latest bar announcements in Trabarnet bar announcement hall<br><br><br>Each time, the beginning of a long-term cooperation<br>Trabarnet drivers application is provided based on your needs, dear drivers, with the aim of solving your constant concerns. This application is very easy to use and our support team will be by your side in all stages from selection to delivery.<br><br>Be in touch with us<br><br>021-57763300<br>Telegram: @taraabarnet<br>Instagram: Taraabarnet",
